ICCT Rack Topology 2.2.1
- Fixed Cacti 1.2.30 installation failure: plugin metadata now supplies required longname/name fields.
- Hardened plugin version metadata parsing with safe defaults.
- Strengthened subtle 3D cabinet top/side depth styling.

ICCT Rack Topology 2.2.0
- Production rack-workspace redesign based on common DCIM rack-view patterns
- All racks rendered horizontally in one workspace; no rack selector
- Adjustable rack width and U-height; Fit All action
- Front view only
- Cacti devices shown in left sidebar with native drag/drop placement
- Peripherals tab with built-in passive rack items
- 3D rack cabinet styling
- Local front-panel SVG stencils for device images
- Device status badges from Cacti host state
- Right-side placement inspector for U-height/stencil changes
- Collision validation across devices and peripherals
- Simplified rack creation: Rack Name + Rack Units only
- Separate paginated audit log
- Cacti full-page refresh suppressed; status refresh is AJAX only

2.3.0
- Fixed stale CSS/JS cache issue by using versioned asset filenames.
- Rebuilt left device/peripheral library to force compact cards and thumbnail sizing.
- Rebuilt rack stage as explicit horizontal flex strip.
- Refined light 3D rack cabinet with front usability plus top/right depth.
